<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-BOLAND NEED 256 TO BEAT BORDER.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BOLAND NEED 256 TO BEAT BORDER.</headline>
<dateline>EAST LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boland, needing 256 from a minimum of 82 overs for victory, were 39 without loss from 11 overs at lunch on the fourth and final day of their Supersport Series match against Border in East London.</p>
<p>Scores: Border 331 and 201-4 declared (Brad White 54, Mark Boucher 68 not out), Boland 277 and 39-0.</p>
</text>
